13:I[8551,["5730","static/chunks/44530001-a024d6c3e41b0954.js","7674","static/chunks/7674-7ab04a97463dfa68.js","8533","static/chunks/8533-4ee6844497278cf5.js","6938","static/chunks/6938-42bfca4f64779e18.js","6743","static/chunks/6743-add5a814ceb59f27.js","1218","static/chunks/1218-2feb1051e2667bbf.js","7421","static/chunks/7421-d6a4450bb877b291.js","7822","static/chunks/7822-584f4eb01faf1901.js","2455","static/chunks/2455-e0ec033315cbc6dc.js","8974","static/chunks/app/page-0270ad5094d5fdce.js"],"default"]
14:T496,Join us for an evening of laughter, socializing, and potential connections at our unique comedy matchmaking event, Match Me Please! Whether you`re looking for love or just want to have a great time, our host will charm the crowd with hilarious crowd play and interactive games designed to bring out the best in everyone. Event Highlights: Comedy & Crowd Play: Our talented host will entertain and engage the audience with witty observations and playful interactions. Matchmaking Fun: Singles will have the chance to meet potential matches in a relaxed and humorous atmosphere. Socializing Opportunities: Enjoy dedicated socializing time between sets to mingle and get to know others. Dress to Impress: Come dressed to impress, as our event creates the perfect backdrop for making a memorable first impression. Laughs & Connections: Laugh along with the crowd and see if you can find that special someone who shares your sense of humor. Whether you`re hoping to find love or just want to enjoy a fun time, Match Me Please! promises to be an evening full of laughter, camaraderie, and maybe even a spark of romance. Get ready to mingle, laugh, and potentially meet your match!15:Ta8d,escape2explore presents Karnataka`s most adventurous, "Skandagiri Sunrise Trek - 2025" ✦ Activity Location: Skandagiri Hill ✦ Start time: 11:00 PM ✦ End time: 01:30 PM ✦ Trek Distance: 5-6 km ✦ Skandagiri Height: 1,450 ft. ✦ Trek Difficulty: Moderate About Skandagiri Sunrise Trek: Do you love adventures and are looking for an exciting and different hiking experience? You need to go no farther than the Skandagiri trek, one of the five peaks in the picturesque Chikballapur area referred to as the "Panchagiris." Nature enthusiasts should not miss this walk, Skandagiri Trek which attracts adventurers of all skill levels with its special fusion of history and natural beauty. A physical trip and a step back is the trek to Skandagiri Hill. It starts with the old Papagni Mutt, a hallowed site from antiquity. What`s Included: ✦ Transportation (Non-AC) ✦ Sunrise Trek ✦ Breakfast ✦ Forest Charges ✦ Guided Trek What`s Excluded: ✦ Water Bottle ✦ Snacks ✦ Anything not mentioned in Inclusions. Itinerary: Day 0 - Bangalore to Skandagiri ➞ Meet at the designated starting point in Bengaluru and travel to Skandagiri by private transportation Day 1 - Trek to Skandagiri Peak ➞ 04:00 AM Reach Skandagiri base and start the trek ➞ 06:00 AM Reach the peak, relax and watch the sunrise view. ➞ 10:30 AM Reach the base back ➞ 10:45 AM Have breakfast at any nearby restaurant ➞ 11:30 PM Start back to Bangalore ➞ 01:30 PM Reach Bangalore Pickup Points: 1. RR Nagar (11:00 PM) - Gopalan Arcade, Mysore road 2. Banashankari (11:30 PM) - Bus Stop 3. BTM (11:40 PM) - Udupi Garden Bus Stop, Near A2B 4. Silk Board (12:00 AM) - Near Krishna Bhavan Restaurant 5. Marathahalli (12:30 AM) - Opposite to Kalamandir 6. Hebball (12:50 AM) - Opposite to Esteem Mall Things to Carry ✦ Torch per person with extra batteries ✦ Government id card ✦ Sports shoes or trekking shoes ✦ Backpack ✦ 2 litre water bottle per person ✦ Energy bars, and drinks ✦ Warm jackets for the night ✦ Track pants and cotton T-shirt ✦ Camera (optional) NOTE: Select Friday Date for Saturday Morning Trek | Select Saturday Date for Sunday Morning Trek ✦ You’ll need to provide a government ID for your Trek Permit (Voter ID, Ration Card, Driving License, PAN Card, or Passport). (Aadhaar Card is not accepted). ✦ Please help us keep the place clean! Do not litter during the trek. ✦ We’re all about nature, so don’t expect luxury. Washrooms are available only at the hotel/homestay campsites. ✦ By joining the trek, you understand and accept the risks involved, which can vary by destination. ✦ escape2explore is not responsible for any lost or misplaced personal items.16:T5ab,Experience the Grandeur of a Karnataka Wedding Feast at Skydeck by Sherlock`s! Craving an authentic culinary adventure? Join us at Skydeck by Sherlock`s for a one-of-a-kind unlimited meal experience! We`re bringing you the rich, traditional flavors of a post-wedding Karnataka feast, served just as it should be on a fresh banana leaf. This is your chance to indulge in an all-you-can-eat spread of exquisite Karnataka cuisine, prepared with age-old recipes and boundless flavor. This limited-time event is designed to transport you to the heart of Karnataka`s culinary heritage. Don`t miss out on this incredible opportunity to savor an unlimited, authentic meal. Spaces are limited, so grab your spot now and prepare for a truly unforgettable gastronomic journey! Unlimited Food - 1199rs Unlimited Food & Beer - 1999rs Unlimited Food, Drinks & Cocktails (IMFL) - 2499rs All-you-can-eat unlimited meals includes: Welcome Drinks: Panaka Spiced-Buttermilk Starters/Sides: Mutton Kheema Unde (Minced Mutton Balls) Mutton Pepper Fry Chicken Ghee Roast Nati-Style Egg Masala Kosambari (Moong + Cucumber Salad) Mains: Mutton Donne Biryani Chicken Donne Biryani Nati Koli Saaru (Country Chicken Curry) Mutton Chops Chicken Fry Ragi Mudde Akki Rotti Kerala Parotta Chapati Accompaniments: Kachumber Salad Mixed Vegetable Palya Lime, Onion & Green Chilli Raita, Pickle & Papad Steamed Rice Rasam Desserts: Obbattu (Holige) Elneer Payasa (Tender Coconut Kheer)17:T645,India's No.1 Live Escape Game, where a team of 2-8 people is locked in a mysterious space for an hour with a mission to accomplish, You must find clues, hints, and mysterious objects, solve puzzles, and challenge all your senses in order to escape in time. Mystery Rooms is a unique adventure game sure to give you an adrenaline rush like never before. So put on your thinking caps, prime your imagination, and sharpen your wits to unravel ultimate mysteries with immersive story lines. Mystery Rooms is a challenging race against the clock where the sole motive is to get yourself out of a theme-based room before time kicks you out! Imagine being locked in a thrill space with your team, and you have exactly 60 minutes to use logic, solve puzzles, find hints, and prove the power of teamwork to pave your path to freedom. It’s as easy as it's hard. Everything you need to escape is inside the room, waiting to meet your eyes! Just analyze, interpret, and conclude! This unique adventure is based on the super hit "Room Escape" games rocking the net all over the world. Starting in Japan, over 10,000,000 participants have played this game in China, Hong Kong, Taiwan, Singapore, Europe, and the United States. We take pride in bringing this extraordinary live escape game experience to your town! The concept is very unique and thrilling, but not at all dangerous, and it does not contain any horror elements. It requires no physical exertion and is suitable for ages 10-77. It is an exciting team-building activity for corporations and a fulfilling fun experience for couples, friends, and families.18:T445,The Experience

An evening at Central Perk for true fans of the iconic six. Test your knowledge of pivots, lobsters, and smelly cats in a competition that separates casual viewers from true Friends devotees.

Three rounds. One unforgettable night.

The Challenge

Round 1: Ascending Difficulty

KBC-style questions that escalate from foundational knowledge to expert-level trivia. Thanksgiving mishaps, Janice appearances, and obscure episode details.

Round 2: Charades

Bring iconic scenes and characters to life through performance. Master Ross's "We were on a break," recreate Monica's competitiveness, or embody Phoebe's quirkiness. Authenticity wins.

Round 3: The Central Perk Challenge

Scenario-based questions demanding deep understanding of relationships, running gags, and character evolution. Think beyond memory—prove mastery.

Details

Expert Host — A dedicated guide ensures seamless execution and spirited competition.

Teams of Two — Arrive with a partner, or we'll match you with a fellow enthusiast.

Grand Prize — Exclusive hamper + monthly unlimited event access.19:T5c0,"Seize the day, my friend. Pehle is din ko poori tarah jiyo, phir chalis ke bare mein sochna." - Zindagi Na Milegi Dobara

All aboard for a night of love, laughter, and unforgettable moments as we bring you the iconic Bollywood masterpiece. Sunset Cinema Club invites you to join us for a cinematic experience that will touch your heart and leave you with a smile at Old Mill Brewing Co.

Immerse yourself in a cinematic night at Old Mill Brewing Co, Bengaluru - a trendy outdoor oasis where the city's pulse meets relaxed vibes. This hidden gem is the perfect blend of urban excitement and cozy charm, serving up delicious eats and drinks to complement the big screen magic. At Old Mill Brewing Co, every movie night is a unique and unforgettable experience.

Screening Schedule: 

22nd  March, Sunday - Zindagi Na Milegi Dobara

Gates open at 7:00 pm and the movie starts at 7:30 pm.

Seating:

We have Bean Bags as seating option available at the venue.

Seating will be allocated on a first come first serve basis. 

F&B: 

Food and beverage options are available at the venue.

Outside Food is not allowed.

Directions: 

SCC SkyCinema is perched on the Rooftop of Old Mill Brewing Co.

**Now you can book a personalized video or photo message to be displayed on-screen during our screenings for up to 1 minute. Select the 'Book a personal on-screen message' while booking the ticket and share your content in advance with us via email to contact@sunsetcinemaclub.in.1a:T495,Centering the Soul: A Pottery Workshop  Step away from the digital hum and find your center at the wheel. Hobby Ghar invites you to an immersive pottery workshop designed to bridge the gap between ancient heritage and modern mindfulness.  In a world of high-speed updates, come experience the slow, rhythmic beauty of shaping raw earth into form.  The Experience Our studio offers a high-aesthetic, minimalist sanctuary where the focus is entirely on the "Sensory Audit" of touch, sight, and sound. Whether you are a first-timer or looking to refine your "Analog Skills," this session is your anchor in a fast-paced world.  The Wheel & The Hand: Learn the foundational art of centering, opening, and pulling clay on the potter`s wheel.  Cognitive Decompression: A guided, meditative flow designed to combat digital burnout and creative fatigue.  Workshop Highlights Tactile Engagement: Feel the physics of the earth as it responds to your touch and momentum. Expert "Hobby Guru" Guidance: Receive personalized instruction in an intimate, supportive environment.  Duration: 30 Minutes. Languages: English, Kannada, Hindi. Artists: shall be implied. 15 people are interested.1b:T5da,Indulge in a gastronomic journey like no other with our continental cooking masterclass!  Are you ready to embark on a culinary adventure that will transport your taste buds to far-off lands and introduce you to the rich tapestry of global flavors?  Join us for an immersive experience where you`ll master the art of cooking authentic dishes from various countries.  🌍 What to Expect:  Expert Guidance: Our seasoned chefs will guide you through the intricacies of each cuisine, sharing time-honored recipes and culinary secrets.  Cultural Insights: Learn about the history and traditions that influence each dish, gaining a deeper appreciation for the cultures that created them.  Hands-On Cooking: Roll up your sleeves and prepare a delectable feast from start to finish, using the freshest ingredients and authentic cooking techniques.  Culinary Connection: Connect with fellow food enthusiasts, share stories, and forge lasting bonds over a shared love for international cuisine.   Whether you`re eager to craft Italian pasta, savor the spices of Indian curries, or explore the umami of Japanese sushi, this workshop promises an unforgettable culinary experience.  Don`t miss this opportunity to broaden your culinary horizons and become a global chef in your own kitchen! Book your spot now and get ready to embark on a culinary world tour with us! 🍽️🌏✨ Duration: 1 hour 30 minutes. Languages: Bengali, English, Hindi, Kannada. Artists: shall be implied. 657 people are interested.1c:T717,Step into a vineyard celebration like no other at Big Banyan Harvest Festival 2026 - a vibrant celebration of the vineyard’s harvest season and a joyful coming together of wine, food, music, and rustic experiences set amid the natural beauty of Big Banyan Vineyard & Resort. Designed as a three-day immersive festival, it captures the romance of grape harvesting traditions while blending them with contemporary lifestyle experiences, making it appealing to families, young audiences, wine lovers, and corporate groups alike. The festival atmosphere is lively yet rooted in authenticity, with décor, storytelling, and activities reflecting the journey from vine to wine.  At its heart, the harvest festival celebrates participation and discovery. Guests step into the role of harvesters through curated grape-picking slots, interactive wine stomping, tasting sessions, vineyard brunches, and themed Hi-Tea experiences. A wide spread of artisan food stalls, smoked meats, barbecue counters, gourmet brunches, dinners and grape-inspired creations, paired with your favourite Big Banyan Wines, elevate the culinary dimension. The Bonfire evenings, curated retail stalls, and rustic vineyard trails add layers of warmth and nostalgia, encouraging guests to slow down, explore, and celebrate the season.  Live entertainment forms the emotional high point each evening. Enjoy live performances every evening by Lagori on Friday, 13th March, Raag The Band on Saturday, 14th March, and a grand finale by Sanjith Hegde on Sunday, 15th March. The mood is electric and exciting. With activities for all ages and picture-perfect vineyard moments, it’s a celebration designed for families, friends, and wine lovers alike 🎶🔥 Duration: 20265 Hours. Languages: Hindi. Artists: shall be implied. 52 people are interested.7:["$","$L13",null,{"initialActivities":[{"id":"97","title":"Shafi Kollam x Saleem Kodathur Live in Concert","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-shafi-kollam-x-saleem-kodathur-live-in-concert-0-2026-2-10-t-12-1-17.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹1500.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["2","3","6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Shafi Kollam x Saleem Kodathur Live in Concert Get ready for an unforgettable musical night as two legendary voices of Mappila and soulful music — Shafi Kollam and Saleem Kodathur — come together on one grand stage. Experience powerful vocals, emotional classics, and high-energy performances that will keep you entertained from start to finish. A spectacular live concert filled with timeless hits, audience-favorite songs, and magical moments. Perfect for music lovers of all ages — this is a show you don’t want to miss!","date":"Mon, 30 Mar, 2026","time":"01:30 am","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.934682,77.614583","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/shafi-kollam-x-saleem-kodathur-live-in-concert/ET00486391","latitude":12.934682,"longitude":77.614583},{"id":"96","title":"SIP AND PAINT","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-sip-and-paint-0-2025-10-16-t-11-16-30.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹499.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["2","8"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Swap small talk for brush strokes and make new friends over a relaxed evening of colours, conversation, and clinks *Inclusions* All Supplies Provided: We’ve got you covered! All painting materials, including canvases, paints, brushes, and aprons, will be provided. A thematic painting blueprint with easy, step-by-step guidance so your piece looks great on your wall Light ice-breakers to help you mingle naturally and find your table buddies without awkward intros. Community host to guide the day! *Who can join?* Absolute beginners who’ve never picked up a brush and want a zero-pressure first time. Busy professionals looking to switch off screens and meet people offline without the bar scene. Hobby painters who love community vibes more than perfect technique. Ready to paint, sip, and meet your kind of people—one brushstroke at a time ?","date":"Sat, 4 Apr, 2026","time":"01:30 am","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.9408,77.6233","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/sip-and-paint/ET00467179","latitude":12.9408,"longitude":77.6233},{"id":"95","title":"Jamming Night","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-jamming-night-0-2026-3-12-t-6-30-7.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹299.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["2","5"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"🎶 Welcome to Jamming Night Here, tunes aren’t just played — they’re felt, shared, and celebrated. Bring your instrument, your voice, or just your love for rhythm, and dive into a cozy circle of music enthusiasts who jam for the sheer joy of it. Whether you’re a seasoned musician, a passionate beginner, or someone who simply grooves to every beat, Jamming Night is your space to create, collaborate, and vibe without boundaries. This isn’t about the perfect performance — it’s about the pure joy of shared creation. So come jam, connect, and let your inner artist breathe at Jamming Night.","date":"Sun, 29 Mar, 2026","time":"01:30 am","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=19.1514,72.8347","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/pookie-jams-the-premium-jamming-experience/ET00461172","latitude":19.1514,"longitude":72.8347},{"id":"94","title":"The Ultimate Malayalam and Bengali Sing-Along Concert","image":"https://instagram.fcok9-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.71878-15/654312775_1653644125818867_8821885516677679930_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=Mzg1NzczMTg3ODYwMDAwODY4NA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InhwaWRzLjY0MHgxMTM2LnNkci5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=qz-uWw2faXkQ7kNvwFKYWU0&_nc_oc=AdpjCV1rLQDD6WxHo3tpNCxTFSWmsA4LkPZd_CCzToCBcCFYmxbeQ4NzkzKXNZyH6Tk&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fcok9-1.fna&_nc_gid=D_uQI-hfuljd6V9VBTHUEQ&_nc_ss=7a32e&oh=00_Afw_6YzWAFRHx-8etYro1RkB2iZuf15R2NpurOuzKqS5rg&oe=69CAC4E2","tags":["concert","sing-along","live-music","bengali"],"priceRange":"NA","location":"Hungry Hippie, Koramangala","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["3"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Comment “MALAYALAM” for the ticket link!! BANGALORE!! We’re back in Koramangala. And this time, we’re bringing 100+ songs. ONE stage. ONE crazy sing-along vibe. 🔥 After that banger February show... it’s time to make the city sing again. March 22| Hungry Hippie, Koramangala 4:00 PM - ADIPOLI The Ultimate Malayalam Sing-Along Concert 7:00 PM - Aashor The Ultimate Bengali Sing-Along Concert","date":"March 22","time":"4:00 PM - ADIPOLI, 7:00 PM - Aashor","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/XdUrrwjgicfSFhng6","contactInfo":"","url":"https://instagram.com/unherd.malayalam","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"93","title":"Art Meet-Cute","image":"https://d10y46cwh6y6x1.cloudfront.net/images/791CC5EE02B64A6FBC23417DCAA07FD7_converted_webp.webp","tags":["art","meetup","beginner-friendly","creative"],"priceRange":"INR 799","location":"Green Theory, Shanthala Nagar, Richmond Town, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["2","3","6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Art Meet-Cute is a gentle evening where strangers sit around a table with paper, colours and small prompts, and let conversations grow naturally. Instead of practiced introductions, you’ll make something with your hands. Instead of awkward questions, there’ll be art, shared silences, small jokes, and the comfort of being around kind people. Come alone. Leave with a page, a memory, or a feeling you can’t quite explain yet. No pressure. No labels. Let art do the talking - the rest can happen between the lines. The space will be gently held and facilitated by Your Journal Project (Yukti). You’ll get: all art materials & thoughtful curiosity-led prompts. You’ll take: your artwork, a new third place to quietly call home, and maybe a date... or at the very least, a friend.","date":"Saturday, March 28","time":"Multiple","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/9NHPAgXbCLPTtQNF6","contactInfo":"","url":"https://urbanaut.app/spot/art-meet-cute","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"92","title":"BENGALURU ART WEEKEND: Single-Day Tickets","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/desktop/media-desktop-single-day-tickets-2026-3-18-t-5-44-14.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹499.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["2"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Book online tickets for BENGALURU ART WEEKEND: Single-Day Tickets on BookMyShow which is a Exhibitions event happening at venue near you. Duration: 7 Hours. Age Limit - 8yrs +.","date":"Tue, 31 Mar, 2026","time":"07:30 pm","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.9835,77.611","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/single-day-tickets/ET00491850","latitude":12.9835,"longitude":77.611},{"id":"91","title":"Match Me Please!","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-match-me-please-0-2024-7-2-t-14-18-20.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹199.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["3","5","6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$14","date":"Sat, 28 Mar, 2026","time":"10:30 pm","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.9341,77.6303","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/match-me-please/ET00403378","latitude":12.9341,"longitude":77.6303},{"id":"90","title":"Skandagiri Trek","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/desktop/media-desktop-skandagiri-trek-2025-12-12-t-5-4-20.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹1599.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["1","2","6","10"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$15","date":"Sat, 28 Mar, 2026","time":"04:30 am","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.936,77.5176","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/activities/skandagiri-sunrise-trek/ET00089280","latitude":12.936,"longitude":77.5176},{"id":"89","title":"Null/OWASP Combined Meet - Bangalore","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540575467063-178a50c2df87?w=800&q=80","tags":[],"priceRange":"Free","location":"Amazon Development Center, Aquila","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Join the Null and OWASP communities for a combined meet-up focused on security and technology. This event is perfect for developers, security enthusiasts, and anyone interested in learning about the latest in cybersecurity practices.","date":"Saturday, 28 March 2026","time":"","mapLink":"","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"88","title":"The Many Lives of the Cat","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541367777708-7905fe3296c0?w=800&q=80","tags":[],"priceRange":"Free","location":"Museum of Art & Photography, Bengaluru","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["2"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Explore the fascinating exhibition 'The Many Lives of the Cat' at the Museum of Art & Photography. This exhibition delves into the cultural significance and artistic representations of cats throughout history. Perfect for art lovers and anyone curious about the relationship between humans and these enigmatic creatures.","date":"Sunday, 29 March 2026","time":"","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.9744743,77.5968712","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":12.9744743,"longitude":77.5968712},{"id":"87","title":"The Baddy Club Week 11","image":"https://instagram.fcok9-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/655115509_17862843330667693_3763636213399269680_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=Mzg2MDQxNDI5MTk0OTc5NDgzNA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InhwaWRzLjEwODB4MTM1MC5zZHIuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=5FV7oJuqCH4Q7kNvwGg2sEp&_nc_oc=Adr5-6vwcIqWDqGdbKlWR14dRFWTE-cnUP7lHwlK-_v6UHhLbp74f2wuRFQ1KWDqEWE&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fcok9-1.fna&_nc_gid=pl-yJJcVZoSGUzQUZ1K37w&_nc_ss=7a32e&oh=00_Afwxg1YDs7Izop1S_51rkk_TZZjjl9sRQlBhoo08dlCB0Q&oe=69CAC8D9","tags":["badminton","sports","social","bengaluru"],"priceRange":"₹500.00","location":"Jump & Smash Badminton Academy, Mahadevapura, Bengaluru","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["4","3"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Join The Baddy Club Week 11 for a fun-filled badminton session.","date":"March 28","time":"10:45 AM - 3:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/noCTtzCqySM6vBPi6","contactInfo":"","url":"https://instagram.com/thebaddyclub","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"86","title":"UDIT NARAYAN x ADITYA NARAYAN Live in Bengaluru","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-udit-narayan-x-aditya-narayan-live-in-bengaluru-0-2025-10-28-t-14-16-3.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹1099.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["2","3"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"🎤✨ Noizz Entertainment presents The Bollywood Blockbuster of 2026 ✨🎶 announcing the first one of 2026 💛 Some voices never fade... They linger in our hearts — echoing through every memory, every melody, every love story ever told. This February 21, 2026, let the golden era of ’90s and 2000s music come alive again! 💫 Witness the legendary Udit Narayan and the ever-charming Aditya Narayan share the stage for a night of timeless tunes, love, and nostalgia. ❤️ 📍 Venue: Phoenix Marketcity, Whitefield 🕕 Time: 6 PM onwards 🎟️ Tickets: Exclusively on BookMyShow Because some melodies don’t age — they just get louder with love. 🎶💖","date":"Sat, 28 Mar, 2026","time":"11:30 pm","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.9978,77.6965","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/udit-narayan-x-aditya-narayan-live-in-bengaluru/ET00468571","latitude":12.9978,"longitude":77.6965},{"id":"85","title":"Beegara Oota - Flavors of Karnataka On Banana Leaf","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/desktop/media-desktop-beegara-oota-flavors-of-karnataka-on-banana-leaf-2026-3-2-t-10-11-8.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹1699.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["2","3","6","9"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$16","date":"Sun, 22 Mar, 2026","time":"05:30 pm","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.975,77.6075","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/activities/beegara-oota-flavors-of-karnataka-on-banana-leaf/ET00455275","latitude":12.975,"longitude":77.6075},{"id":"84","title":"Mystery Rooms - Whitefield","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-mystery-rooms-whitefield-0-2024-2-7-t-11-0-42.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹1000.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["2","3","5","6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$17","date":"Sat, 28 Mar, 2026","time":"07:30 pm","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.9685,77.7457","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/activities/mystery-rooms-whitefield/ET00370511","latitude":12.9685,"longitude":77.7457},{"id":"83","title":"Pottery Hug","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-pottery-hug-0-2025-3-15-t-3-34-18.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹899.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["2","6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Join us for Pottery Hug, a unique and intimate pottery experience where you don’t just shape the clay—you embrace it! Whether you come solo or with a partner, this hands-on workshop invites you to hug and mold pottery, deepening your connection with the art and each other. This heartwarming experience is designed to strengthen bonds, promote mindfulness, and create something truly special—just like your relationships. Feel the warmth of the clay, the closeness of your embrace, and the joy of shaping art together. Come, hug, mold, and create magic!","date":"Wed, 25 Mar, 2026","time":"07:30 pm","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.9341,77.6303","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/pottery-hug/ET00438160","latitude":12.9341,"longitude":77.6303},{"id":"82","title":"Smash & Sip: Badminton + Coffee Evening","image":"https://circles-in-app.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/production/U2d6e121304/event/compressed_0_1764226831544.jpg","tags":["5"],"priceRange":"249","location":"Sree Rama Badminton Academy, Kasturi Nagar Main Road, Doctors Layout, East of NGEF Layout, Banganapalli, Bengalur","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["7"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"A fun weekend badminton session for anyone who loves to play and meet few new faces.\n\nWhether you're dreading the coming week or just looking to get active and unwind, join us for an hour session of casual, mixed-level badminton. Come solo or with a friend — we’ll rotate players and keep the energy light and fun.\n\nWhat to Expect\n- Casual doubles badminton\n- No fixed teams – rotating partners throughout\n- No coaching, no drills – just open play\n- All are welcome – regardless of skill level\n\nWhat to Bring\n- Non-marking sports shoes (Available on 50/- rent )\n- Racket\n- Comfortable attire and weekend spirit\nNote: Coffee after the session is not included in the ticket\n\nWhy Join?\nBecause weekends aren’t just for chilling — they’re also for smashing a few rallies, breaking a sweat, and maybe meeting someone who serves better than your doubles partner.\n\nNote: Please wear activewear for the game.\n\n\nGot a question? Ping us on WhatsApp at +91 9266064455","date":"Mar 21 , 2026","time":" 05:00 PM - 07:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/nVbUhSG3pye4YZob7","contactInfo":"","url":"https://web.circlesinapp.com/smash-sip-badminton-coffee-evening/E11b0041815/","latitude":13.0070039,"longitude":77.6537356},{"id":"81","title":"Event Event MAFIA NIGHT","image":"https://circles-in-app.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/production/U0885070708/event/compressed_0_1773745240394.jpg","tags":[],"priceRange":"399","location":"Dialogues Cafe Koramangala","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":[],"categoryNames":[],"description":"The town sleeps… the mafia wakes up 🕯️\n\nJoin us for MAFIA NIGHT 🔪\nA room full of strangers, secret roles, loud accusations, and absolute chaos.\n\nJoin us for a fully hosted game of Mafia with a room full of strangers, secret roles, loud accusations, fake friendships & absolute chaos 😈\n\n📍Dialogues Cafe, Koramangala\n📅 22nd March Sunday\n⏰ 7 PM onwards\n💌 Rs. 399/- Only (Includes ₹150 redeemable coupon on F&B & Fomo hosts to keep the drama going🤪)\n\nYou’ll lie, defend yourself, get betrayed, and scream “IT’S NOT ME” at least once.\n\nNote:•All bookings are non-refundable.\n• ⁠A WhatsApp group will be created 1 day before the event to share all important information✨","date":"Mar 22 , 2026","time":"07:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/oJRHU3eSUDzTxsjY8","contactInfo":"","url":"https://web.circlesinapp.com/mafia-night/E2760022509/","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"80","title":"Friends Trivia Night","image":"https://media.insider.in/image/upload/c_crop,g_custom/v1770303876/t39a9qv35k3gavyjxezh.png","tags":["5"],"priceRange":"499","location":"Bramble Kitchen & Bar, Bengaluru","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":[],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$18","date":"Mar 21 , 2026","time":"08:00 PM","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps?q=12.9170248,77.57933249999999","contactInfo":"","url":"https://www.district.in/events/friends-trivia-night-feb6-2026-buy-tickets","latitude":12.9170248,"longitude":77.5793325},{"id":"79","title":"Screening Mathieu Kassovitz’s La Haine","image":"https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/649226754_17858557662616671_7901697366252621239_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=Mzg0OTExMjUwNzg5NDcxMDk1Mg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InhwaWRzLjEzNTB4MTY4OC5zZHIuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=5NAYR6_v7coQ7kNvwGXULEo&_nc_oc=AdqHDseZEn3I5jZFt3ULGssXUuThqjNd7kNFtX7FPsH2QWkasZnSnVqMnfl6yCDoGT8&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna&_nc_gid=EBYorFLsP9NNbeL_fL2DMg&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy3_gBJ8IlZpi_1w0QASreug_iW4_2WvKk8XFyiumpG3w&oe=69C15245","tags":["5"],"priceRange":"Free","location":"Bangalore Local","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Screening Mathieu Kassovitz’s La Haine this Saturday at The Bangalore Local.\n\nThis is in collaboration with Alliance Francaise, Bangalore.","date":"Mar 14, 2026","time":"6:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/b3hmmw2rXgXZCzAJA","contactInfo":"","url":"https://www.cinemanextdoor.com/","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"78","title":"SCC SkyCinema - Zindagi Na Milegi Dobara","image":"https://sunsetcinemaclub.in/event-gallery/45","tags":["5"],"priceRange":"600","location":"Old Mill Brewing Co. , Varthur","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["3","6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$19","date":"Mar 22 , 2026","time":"07:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/H17Hxc6TiRHMot7g9","contactInfo":"","url":"https://sunsetcinemaclub.in/bangalore/events/2459/scc-skycinema-zindagi-na-milegi-dobara","latitude":12.9245877,"longitude":77.7343105},{"id":"77","title":"Pickleball with Strangers","image":"https://media.insider.in/image/upload/c_crop,g_custom/v1766580687/opwlahgu79eceu3nehql.jpg","tags":["5"],"priceRange":"425","location":"Paddle Park,Bengaluru","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["4","8"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"A relaxed weekend pickleball session for anyone who wants to move, rally, laugh and meet a few fresh faces.\n\nWhether you’re unwinding from the week or kicking off your Saturday night with a little friendly sport — come join us for a mixed-level pickleball run. Come solo or bring a buddy — we’ll rotate partners so everyone gets a chance to play.\n\nWhat to Expect\n\nCasual pickleball games (no pro coaching)\n\nRotating doubles so everyone plays + meets new partners\n\nEasy vibe — competition optional\n\nOpen to all — beginners welcome, intermediates welcome, everyone fits in\n\n(Covers court booking, paddles (limited), balls & water)\n\nWhat to Bring\n\nComfortable non-marking shoes\n\nYour own paddle (if you have one — we’ll have a few extras)","date":"Mar 22 , 2026","time":"05:00 PM - 06:00 PM","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps?q=13.0182963,77.6592165","contactInfo":"","url":"https://www.district.in/events/pickleball-with-strangers-jan3-2026-buy-tickets","latitude":13.0182963,"longitude":77.6592165},{"id":"76","title":"The Svasthya Run 2026","image":"https://runnersduniya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/The-Svasthya-Run.jpeg","tags":["5"],"priceRange":"699 ","location":"GKVK Campus, Bengaluru","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["4"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"🔥 Run for Your Health. Run for a Cause. Run for YOU! 🏃‍♀️🏃‍♂️\n\n🌿✨ The Svasthya Run 2026 is here, and this is not your ordinary run. It is a celebration of movement, wellness, and mindful living!\n\nThis event aims to promote wellness, joy, and a healthier lifestyle through community participation.\n\nDate: 22 March 2026\n\nTime: 6:00 AM\n\nLocation: GKVK Campus, Bengaluru\n\nCategories: 3KM, 5KM, and 10KM\n\nRegistration Fees: 3K – ₹699, 5K – ₹799, 10K – ₹899\n\nOrganizer: I-AIM Healthcare/TDU\n\n💚 Spots are filling fast, do not wait until it’s too late.\n\n💚 Lace up, show up, and be part of a healthier, happier community movement!","date":"Mar 22 , 2026","time":"6:00 AM","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/YZmjVqpSbh1LKcw98","contactInfo":"","url":"https://runnersduniya.com/event/the-svasthya-run/","latitude":13.0858815,"longitude":77.5611937},{"id":"75","title":"Screening of Arsenal vs Man City - Final Clash | BWW PMC","image":"https://media.insider.in/image/upload/c_crop,g_custom/v1773818369/xfjrlxpiah6yesprhecq.jpg","tags":["5"],"priceRange":"500","location":"Buffalo Wild Wings | Phoenix Marketcity Bangalore, Whitefield, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["4"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Arsenal vs Manchester City Premier League Final Cup\n\nReady for an electrifying night of football as Arsenal take on Manchester City in a high-stakes Premier League Final Cup clash.","date":"Mar 22 , 2026","time":"10:00 PM","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps?q=12.9977,77.6971","contactInfo":"","url":"https://www.district.in/events/final-clash-arsenal-vs-man-city-bww-pmc-mar22-2026-buy-tickets","latitude":12.9977,"longitude":77.6971},{"id":"74","title":"Ungrateful by Vineeth Srinivasan","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-ungrateful-by-vineeth-srinivasan-0-2025-1-7-t-7-56-44.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹499.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["3"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"If one were to describe Vineeth Srinivasan’s (he’s referring to himself in 3rd person) first stand up comedy tour in three words, they would be - Bothered Unmoisturised Continuous lane cutting If this describes you, Get help Or buy tickets for the show. Actually do both. See you soon In a city you live in. Obviously. Where else.","date":"Sun, 22 Mar, 2026","time":"01:30 am","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=19.0705,72.8398","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/ungrateful-by-vineeth-srinivasan/ET00427956","latitude":19.0705,"longitude":72.8398},{"id":"73","title":"Candlelight Open Air: Tribute to A.R. Rahman","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501386761578-eaa54b4b5c57?w=800&q=80","tags":[],"priceRange":"₹800 onwards","location":"Cubbon Park, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["3"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Join us for a magical evening under the stars as we pay tribute to the legendary A.R. Rahman. Enjoy his timeless music performed by talented artists in the serene setting of Cubbon Park.","date":"Sunday, 22 March 2026","time":"6:30 PM","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.9742535,77.5921906","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":12.9742535,"longitude":77.5921906},{"id":"72","title":"Nithin Kamath Live -The Birthday Show!","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-nithin-kamath-live-the-birthday-show-0-2025-3-10-t-7-39-21.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹399.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["3"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Namaskaara! Catch the Kannada comedy sensation Nithin Kamath in all his elements on the much awaited “The Birthday Show!”. With a wit sharper than an auto rickshaw’s turn and jokes fresher than a filter kaapi, this Pakka local Hudga is all set to get you laugh until it hurts!","date":"Sun, 22 Mar, 2026","time":"11:30 pm","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.960176,77.646828","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/nithin-kamath-live-the-birthday-show/ET00390457","latitude":12.960176,"longitude":77.646828},{"id":"71","title":"Tempo Tantrums - Kenny Sebastian (Comedy Show)","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/desktop/media-desktop-tempo-tantrums-kenny-sebastian-comedy-show--2026-1-26-t-8-16-21.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹999.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["3","5","6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Get ready for an unforgettable night with Kenny Sebastian as he blends razor-sharp comedy with playful music in Tempo Tantrums — a one-of-a-kind live experience where laughter meets melody. Known for his observational humour, charming stage presence, and unpredictable musical twists, Kenny takes you on a hilarious journey through everyday absurdities, unexpected tempo shifts, and stories that hit all the right notes.","date":"Sun, 22 Mar, 2026","time":"10:00 pm","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=19.0639,72.8334","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/tempo-tantrums-kenny-sebastian/ET00480918","latitude":19.0639,"longitude":72.8334},{"id":"70","title":"Soul Jams | Bengaluru","image":"https://media.insider.in/image/upload/c_crop,g_custom/v1772815644/xtfcnoftht3y9uu3cbq3.png","tags":[],"priceRange":"499","location":"Brigade Road , Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["2"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Soul Jams is the ultimate destination for music lovers! Join us for an evening of relaxation, unwinding, and rejuvenation. Our welcoming space allows you to be yourself and feel at home.\n\nBring your guitars, cajones, and voices to sing your heart out alongside our vibrant community in a beautiful jamming session. You can also enjoy listening to amazing artists or take the stage yourself, supported by an accepting and supportive community.\n\nThe event comprises three soul-enriching parts:\n\nSoul Open Mic: Perform for a warm and appreciative audience, regardless of where you are on your musical journey. Alternatively, simply chill and enjoy the incredible performers.\n\nSoul Circle: Connect with like-minded individuals and find your tribe, fostering meaningful connections.\n\nSoul Jamming: Sing, play instruments, and join the community in a spontaneous, free-flowing musical experience. We create music together, fostering an atmosphere of refreshment and excitement.","date":"Mar 14 , 2026","time":"04:30 PM ","mapLink":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/hz2s3Je82mFn7As59","contactInfo":"","url":"https://www.district.in/events/soul-jams-bengaluru-mar14-2026-buy-tickets?fbclid=PAZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQMMjU2MjgxMDQwNTU4AAGng7QEIkFjyIwfhePHGIaEAp-HXsoZISKVs8k7znHky3u7TBit9O2itzEY4pI_aem_Ny8Vvj-FutcK8UmMaxwTvg&source_caller=api&pid=SocialShare&utm_content=link_in_bio&utm_source=ig&shortlink=0vonj5r1&utm_medium=social&deep_link_value=edition%3A%2F%2Fresolve-onelink%3Flink_type%3Dopen_event_details_page%26link_params%3D%7B%22event_id%22%3A%2269aace4004834cf3422889a7%22%2C%22event_slug%22%3A%22soul-jams-bengaluru-mar14-2026%22%7D%26utm_source%3DSocialShare%26share_tag%3D%2FNGeopDHkMFDHCnnKfbzyOnqCHald51zwDP3OFPkIclrRv%2Fj&link_params=%7B%22event_id%22:%2269aace4004834cf3422889a7%22,%22event_slug%22:%22soul-jams-bengaluru-mar14-2026%22%7D&link_type=open_event_details_page","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"69","title":"Paint with Puppies","image":"https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/649229178_18136418191502128_4127452141281420576_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ig_cache_key=Mzg0OTgyODM2NzAzODgyODA2NQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InhwaWRzLjEzNDl4MTY4NS5zZHIuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=-aXf0TgfaR0Q7kNvwH2VPx8&_nc_oc=AdlIP3iaG578CG