"url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"63","title":"Continental Cooking Masterclass","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-continental-cooking-masterclass-0-2024-3-14-t-6-22-21.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹999","location":"minutesAll age groupsBengali, English, Hindi, Kannada, Malaya...Brik Oven, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["2","6","8","9"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$1b","date":"Sat 18 Apr 2026","time":"01:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=minutesAll%20age%20groupsBengali%2C%20English%2C%20Hindi%2C%20Kannada%2C%20Malaya...Brik%20Oven%2C%20Bangalore","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"62","title":"Big Banyan Harvest Festival 2026","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/desktop/media-desktop-big-banyan-harvest-festival-2026-2026-3-3-t-13-48-1.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹349","location":"HoursAll age groupsInternationalRanch, Big Banyan Vineyard, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["2","3","4","6","9","10"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$1c","date":"Sun 15 Mar 2026","time":"04:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=HoursAll%20age%20groupsInternationalRanch%2C%20Big%20Banyan%20Vineyard%2C%20Bangalore","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"61","title":"Stand up Comedy Live at Koramangala","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-stand-up-comedy-live-at-koramangala-0-2024-6-13-t-10-5-42.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹199","location":"English, HindiComedyThe Underground Comedy Club, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["11"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Comedy Shots presents Wild comedy nights. Come on down with friends, family, enemies, random strangers,or by yourself for an absurd, edgy, and funny evening as these Bangalore regulars try to crack you up with their jokes. A stand-up comedy night to remember. Duration: 1 hour 20 minutes. Age Limit - 16yrs. Languages: English, Hindi. Artists: shall be implied. 816 people are interested.","date":"Sun 15 Mar 2026","time":"09:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=English%2C%20HindiComedyThe%20Underground%20Comedy%20Club%2C%20Bangalore","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"60","title":"Kids Painting Party","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-kids-painting-party-0-2025-1-31-t-14-16-49.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹799","location":"LEARN Phoenix Market, city, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["2","6","8","9","11"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Looking for a colorful weekend escape? Bring your kids to our Canvas Painting Workshop and help them create their unique masterpiece! 🖌️ Here’s what’s in store: 🌟 Take-home Canvas— For Kids to keep and cherish. 🎨 All Supplies Provided— Kids bring the creativity, we’ll bring the tools! 👩‍🎨 Step-by-Step Guidance from an experienced instructor. 🎉 Good vibes, great food, and plenty of laughs for a memorable time!  Duration: 2 Hours. Languages: English, Hindi. Artists: shall be implied. 106 people are interested.","date":"Sun 15 Mar 2026","time":"03:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=LEARN%20Phoenix%20Market%2C%20city%2C%20Bangalore","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"59","title":"SCC SkyCinema - Jab We Met","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-scc-skycinema-jab-we-met-0-2026-2-21-t-3-31-39.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹450","location":"KolkataPregame, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["2","8","9"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"“Mein Apni Favourite Hoon.” — Jab We Met Relive the charm of this iconic love story filled with laughter, romance, and unforgettable moments with Sunset Cinema Club at Forum South Bengaluru Mall. Enjoy an open-air movie night on a breezy rooftop, relaxing on comfy bean bags or mattresses under the stars with a stunning skyline backdrop. 14th March (Saturday) | Gates: 7:00 PM | Movie: 7:30 PM Seating first-come-first-served (2 tickets per mattress). Food available; outside snacks allowed. Access via lift near Prestige Centre for Performing Arts. Duration: 2 hours 20 minutes. Artists: shall be implied. 4 people are interested.","date":"Sat 14 Mar 2026","time":"7:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=KolkataPregame%2C%20Bangalore","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"58","title":"Sanjith Hegde Live at Big Banyan  Harvest Festival","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/desktop/media-desktop-sanjith-hegde-live-at-big-banyan-harvest-festival-2026-3-9-t-9-25-8.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹749","location":"minutesAll age groupsContemporaryRanch, Big Banyan Vineyard, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["3","5"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Sanjith Hegde, the dynamic playback singer from Bengaluru, brings his electrifying energy to the Big Banyan Harvest Festival 2026. Trained in Hindustani classical music, he rose to fame with his powerful performances and has since become a versatile voice across Kannada, Tamil, Telugu, and Hindi music industries.  Known for hits like “Gunu Gunuguva” and his ability to effortlessly blend classical depth with contemporary pop, rock, and R&B influences, Sanjith’s music resonates with both young audiences and connoisseurs alike.  With multiple awards and a reputation for high-energy live shows, he promises a captivating performance set against the scenic charm of the vineyard—making it a night of music, rhythm, and unforgettable vibes. 🎶✨ Duration: 1 hour 30 minutes. Languages: Kannada, Tamil, Telugu. Artists: shall be implied. 212 people are interested.","date":"Sun 15 Mar 2026","time":"07:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=minutesAll%20age%20groupsContemporaryRanch%2C%20Big%20Banyan%20Vineyard%2C%20Bangalore","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"57","title":"Let's Jam Music Experience","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-let-s-jam-music-experience-0-2026-3-6-t-14-34-45.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹499","location":"minutesAll age groupsHindiBollywoodArena Brewhouse, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"200+ Music Lovers. 100+ NOSTALGIC Songs. EPIC STORYTELLING & JAM EXPERIENCE!  What to Expect? Join us for a night of singing, dancing, musical games, open mics, and nonstop Bollywood nostalgia.  🎙️ Open Mic – Watch Crazy Talent in Bangalore First! DM us on Instagram to perform! 🎲 Musical Games – You Get the Mic, Answer Riddles and sing those songs along! 🎶 Let’s Jam – Sing along to Kishore, Rafi, SRK, KK and more with the crowd. 🍔 Meet People Like You – Music brings people together plus our games get your talking to NEW People!  🎟️ Book now for the ultimate live Bollywood music experience. Duration: 3 hours 30 minutes. Languages: Hindi. Artists: shall be implied. 1 people are interested.","date":"Sat 14 Mar 2026","time":"04:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=minutesAll%20age%20groupsHindiBollywoodArena%20Brewhouse%2C%20Bangalore","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"56","title":"Healer Circle","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-healer-circle-0-2025-10-10-t-5-19-2.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹199","location":"PuneCafe du L`Amour, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"Feeling emotionally drained or just craving real conversations? Come join us at our Healer Circle — a safe, social space to connect, share, and recharge with like-minded people.  We’ve designed this gathering to foster openness, empathy, and deeper human connection — where everyone listens, supports, and heals together through simple conversations.  Our guided prompts and mindful ice breakers make it easy to open up, reflect, and leave feeling lighter, understood, and re-energized. Duration: 1 hour 30 minutes. Languages: Bengali, English, Hindi, Kannada. Artists: shall be implied. 401 people are interested.","date":"Sat 11 Apr 2026","time":"04:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=PuneCafe%20du%20L%60Amour%2C%20Bangalore","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"},{"id":"55","title":"Anime Lovers Meet-up","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-anime-lovers-meet-up-0-2025-10-10-t-6-4-54.jpg","tags":["Event","Sports"],"priceRange":"₹199","location":"PuneCafe du L`Amour, Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/19/2026","categoryIds":["5"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"🎌 Anime Lovers Meet-up 🎌 Calling all otakus and anime fans! 💥 Join the squad for fun conversations, anime debates, cosplay vibes, and maybe a few “dattebayo!” moments. Whether you’re into Naruto, One Piece, JJK, or slice-of-life classics — this is your zone to connect, vibe, and make new friends who get your anime obsession! 💫  Duration: 1 hour 30 minutes. Languages: Bengali, English, Hindi, Kannada. Artists: shall be implied. 316 people are interested.","date":"Sun 5 Apr 2026","time":"06:00 PM","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=PuneCafe%20du%20L%60Amour%2C%20Bangalore","contactInfo":"","url":"","latitude":"$undefined","longitude":"$undefined"}],"initialCategories":[{"id":"1","name":"food","emoji":"✨"},{"id":"2","name":"music","emoji":"✨"},{"id":"3","name":"art","emoji":"✨"},{"id":"4","name":"sports","emoji":"✨"},{"id":"5","name":"comedy","emoji":"✨"},{"id":"6","name":"theater","emoji":"✨"},{"id":"7","name":"workshops","emoji":"✨"},{"id":"8","name":"outdoor",